{"3065800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Marathon", "steam_appid": 3065800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4623170, 4623200, 3569830], "detailed_description": "<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/445b899ded3089455e5fd5ddd24d6115.avif?t=1786061300\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras_big/445b899ded3089455e5fd5ddd24d6115.avif?t=1786061300 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Marathon Deluxe Edition includes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Standard Edition content   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1x Premium Rewards Pass Voucher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 SILK Rewards Pass Tokens</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Cosmetics:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIDNIGHT DECAY Misriah 2442 Pump Shotgun Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIDNIGHT DECAY Overrun AR Style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runner Shell Cosmetics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIDNIGHT DECAY Vandal Shell Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIDNIGHT DECAY Destroyer Shell Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIDNIGHT DECAY Assassin Shell Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIDNIGHT DECAY Thief Shell Style</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/f003b08f1163d02125a3fd3bc7f05e4e.poster.avif?t=1786061300\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/f003b08f1163d02125a3fd3bc7f05e4e.webm?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/f003b08f1163d02125a3fd3bc7f05e4e.mp4?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate the dark sci-fi world of Marathon filled with rival players, enemy forces, and unpredictable dangers. Scavenge its maps alone or with a crew, then fight your way to extraction in tense, high-stakes PVP and PVE battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE AND THRIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/0c1d2ddc1eb66f6834217df4145b61fa.poster.avif?t=1786061300\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/0c1d2ddc1eb66f6834217df4145b61fa.webm?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/0c1d2ddc1eb66f6834217df4145b61fa.mp4?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour dangerous locations for valuables, loot, and intel on the lost colony. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab gear off defeated players and enemies. Exfil successfully and fill your vault.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete contracts to earn rewards, upgrade your loadout, and come back stronger.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR STRATEGY, YOUR RUNNER </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/66f103462965f068762163bc86cc1cd5.poster.avif?t=1786061300\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/66f103462965f068762163bc86cc1cd5.webm?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/66f103462965f068762163bc86cc1cd5.mp4?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a Runner shell that fits your playstyle, each with its own unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your loadout with an arsenal of moddable weapons and customizable abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft countless builds, from stealthy infiltrators to frontline bruisers and support specialists.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COUNT ON YOUR CREW, TRUST YOURSELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/9055695cb8310550cfd15d60957fff7c.poster.avif?t=1786061300\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/9055695cb8310550cfd15d60957fff7c.webm?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/9055695cb8310550cfd15d60957fff7c.mp4?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crew up in groups of two or three or take on Tau Ceti alone.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form cautious alliances balanced on a knife’s edge. Make a deal with enemy players or betray their trust for your own gain. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rook, a lone scavenger with nothing to lose except what you find along the way.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUSH AHEAD, GROW YOUR POWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a